      {
        "html_url": "https://github.com/sev7n4/aimarket/commit/bedae2feee7babd257574ed58e6263fd34b339e8",
        "sha": "bedae2feee7babd257574ed58e6263fd34b339e8",
        "repository": "sev7n4/aimarket",
        "message": "feat(agent): LangGraph 编排 P0+P1 与 Agent Run API (#98)\n\n* feat(agent): LangGraph 编排 P0+P1 与 Agent Run API\n\n引入 @aimarket/agent-core（多厂商编排 LLM、LangGraph 会话图）与 agent_runs\n持久化；/agent/plan 支持 LLM+fallback，新增 /agent/runs 生命周期与 Job 完成\n自动 resume。补充技术规格文档与集成测试。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(docker): 构建时包含并编译 @aimarket/agent-core\n\nDockerfile.api 复制 agent-core 包并在 API 编译前先 build；\nCI lint 阶段同步增加 agent-core build，修复 docker-build 找不到模块。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(agent-core): typecheck 使用 src 类型入口，避免 CI 需先 build\n\nexports.types 指向 src；补充 API 侧 PlanStep/AgentSessionState 注解。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(ci): 启动 API 前先 build agent-core\n\ntsx 运行期依赖 dist/index.js；start-api 与 Integration 流程补齐\nagent-core 编译及 orchestration 集成测试步骤。\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
